<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 3.1 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 3.1 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Consumer Price Index (CPI) for February rose 3.1 percent from the same month a year ago, the Statistics Department said on Monday.</p>
<p>In January, the CPI grew 3.2 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p> CONSUMER PRICE INDEX	Feb 97    Jan 97    Feb 96</p>
<p> Change year/year pct	3.1	 3.2	 3.4</p>
<p> Index (base year 1994)    109.5     108.9     106.2</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
